\newlabel{tab:overall}{{2}{5}{Overall means over the eight scenes (scene mean over the reported horizons) for the three Teacher models, and relative change $\Delta $ of Global (GV) and Agent-Centric (AV) with respect to No-Video (NV). Lower is better except where it measures dispersion}{table.caption.6}{}}
